vulnerabilities.suggested_fix:
Return the minimum of allowance and actual balance:
```solidity
function _incomingTokenBalance() internal view override returns (uint256) {
    uint256 allowance = erc20Token.allowance(msg.sender, address(this));
    uint256 balance = erc20Token.balanceOf(msg.sender);
    return allowance < balance ? allowance : balance;
}
```
This preserves the intended “lock all available/approved” behavior even with unlimited allowances.
